- Tomoko Senda is a glassblower based in Duluth, Minnesota.
- She has been working with glass since 2009.
- Her pieces include delicate ornamental hummingbirds only 4 centimeters long.
- She also creates large-scale sculptural installations weighing up to 90 kilograms.
- Her work has been exhibited at the Corning Museum of Glass and at the Minneapolis Institute of Art.', $lyceon_json$[{"key":"A","text":"Duluth-based glassblower Tomoko Senda, who has been working with glass since 2009, has exhibited at the Corning Museum of Glass and the Minneapolis Institute of Art."},{"key":"B","text":"Tomoko Senda is a glassblower in Duluth, Minnesota, whose work ranges from delicate ornamental hummingbirds only 4 centimeters long to large-scale sculptural installations weighing up to 90 kilograms."},{"key":"C","text":"Since 2009, Tomoko Senda has been creating glass art in Duluth, Minnesota, and her pieces have been shown at several well-known museums."},{"key":"D","text":"Glassblower Tomoko Senda, based in Duluth, creates ornamental hummingbirds that are only 4 centimeters long and has been working with glass since 2009."}]$lyceon_json$::jsonb, 'B', NULL, E'The goal is to emphasize the range of Senda''s work. The option stating that her work ranges from delicate 4-centimeter hummingbirds to 90-kilogram sculptural installations directly highlights the contrast in scale, fulfilling the goal. The option focusing on exhibition venues and start date emphasizes her career credentials rather than the range of her work. The option mentioning several well-known museums is vague about the work itself and omits the specific size contrast. The option mentioning only the small hummingbirds and her start date presents just one end of the range, failing to convey the breadth of her output.', $lyceon_json${"A":{"role":"distractor","error_taxonomy":"rhetorical_purpose_error"},"B":{"role":"correct","error_taxonomy":null},"C":{"role":"distractor","error_taxonomy":"detail_misread"},"D":{"role":"distractor","error_taxonomy":"partial_reasoning"}}$lyceon_json$::jsonb, NULL, 'draft', 1, 75, false, $lyceon_json${"provenance":"Lyceon original","authored_by":"claude","authored_date":"2026-08-19"}$lyceon_json$::jsonb, $lyceon_json${"model":"claude","generation_date":"202